{"key": "g06", "title": "The 25 Most Common Nouns in the Qur'an", "subtitle": "Learn these and you will recognise thousands of words", "trigger_at": "2026-12-08T13:00:00.000Z", "body": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "captionedImage", "content": [{"type": "image2", "__img": "cover-g06.png", "alt": "The 25 Most Common Nouns in the Qur'an"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "If you learn just these 25 nouns, you will recognise thousands of words across the Qur'an. Here they are, from most to least common, with how many times each appears."}]}, {"type": "ordered_list", "attrs": {"start": 1, "type": null, "order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Lord, Sustainer:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " رَبّ, 975 times"}]}]}, {"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "earth:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " أَرْض, 461 times"}]}]}, {"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "people, a nation:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " قَوْم, 383 times"}]}]}, {"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "a sign, a verse:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " آيَة, 382 times"}]}]}, {"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "every, all:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " كُلّ, 358 times"}]}]}, {"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "messenger:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " رَسُول, 332 times"}]}]}, {"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "day:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " يَوْم, 325 times"}]}]}, {"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "punishment:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " عَذَاب, 322 times"}]}]}, {"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "sky, heaven:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " سَمَاء, 310 times"}]}]}, {"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "soul, self:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " نَفْس, 295 times"}]}]}, {"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "a thing:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " شَيْء, 283 times"}]}]}, {"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "a book:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " كِتَاب, 260 times"}]}]}, {"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "truth:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " حَقّ, 242 times"}]}]}, {"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "people, mankind:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " نَاس, 241 times"}]}]}, {"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "before:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " قَبْل, 197 times"}]}]}, {"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "believer:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " مُؤْمِن, 195 times"}]}]}, {"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "path, way:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " سَبِيل, 176 times"}]}]}, {"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "command, matter:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " أَمْر, 166 times"}]}]}, {"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "some:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " بَعْض, 157 times"}]}]}, {"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "O (calling):", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " أَيُّهَا, 153 times"}]}]}, {"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "good, better:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " خَيْر, 148 times"}]}]}, {"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "god, deity:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " إِلَٰه, 147 times"}]}]}, {"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "fire:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " نَار, 145 times"}]}]}, {"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "other than, not:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " غَيْر, 144 times"}]}]}, {"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "besides, other than:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " دُون, 135 times"}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"textAlign": null, "level": 3}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Three things to notice"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The top word is رَبّ \"Lord\".", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Nearly a thousand times, the Qur'an names Allah as the one who creates, raises and looks after. You met it in Al-Fatihah: رَبِّ الْعَالَمِينَ \"Lord of all the worlds\"."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Two words for \"people\".", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " قَوْم is a particular nation, as in قَوْمِ نُوحٍ \"the people of Noah\"; نَاس is people in general, the last word of the Qur'an (114:6)."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Some \"nouns\" work like prepositions.", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " قَبْل \"before\", بَعْض \"some\", غَيْر \"other than\" and دُون \"besides\" are nouns in Arabic grammar, but in English we translate them as small linking words. You will see them almost on every page."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Try this:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " open any page of the Qur'an and count how many of these 25 you can find."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "From my book", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Quran Grammar Summary "}, {"type": "text", "text": "(second edition), section 6.1, which lists the top 300 nouns, the top 300 verbs and every particle in the Qur'an.", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Download this post as a PDF", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", with all the Arabic in Qur'anic script: "}, {"type": "text", "text": "The 25 Most Common Nouns in the Qur'an (PDF)", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://www.seemabooks.com/downloads/substack-posts/g06-the-25-most-common-nouns-in-the-qur-an.pdf", "target": "_blank", "rel": "noopener noreferrer nofollow", "class": null}}]}]}]}}